[primary] current root fact of this bundle; use it as the anchor for final wording.
[[ equivalent_label ]] same fact as [[ parent_desc ]]; merge wording and remove redundancy, but keep all details.
[[ attached_label ]] adds or refines [[ parent_desc ]]; weave it in naturally and keep all points.
[[ superseded_label ]] earlier state relative to [[ parent_desc ]] (true at that time, not an error); keep it and describe the change to the current state.
